WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:05,650
Poor, sad and prosperous

2
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,210
You can eat whatever you want. There are only so many things.

3
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,210
Give it to you. What should I eat?

4
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,650
Eat your ass

5
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:11,090
You deserve to starve to death

6
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:13,050
Keep your voice down, I'm afraid the neighbors won't hear you

7
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,450
Mom, if you don’t come to eat again

8
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:15,570
I ate your fat too

9
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:21,440
It’s coming, it’s coming, eat quickly

10
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,240
If you gather everything together and lock it up for two days, you will be honest.

11
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,180
I'm not on a mission

12
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,300
dead?

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:43,330
I've traveled through time

14
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:44,650
Still sixty years

15
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:46,850
Yuan Zu’s whole family eats big fish and meat every day

16
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:47,810
Even the wild dogs passing by

17
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:51,730
You can get a bone

18
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:54,050
The original ancestors competed with wild dogs for food every day

19
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,340
Until that night I was so hungry that I couldn't bear it anymore

20
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:02,140
Then I secretly drank two mouthfuls of northwest wind.

21
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:06,200
After being discovered by my parents like this

22
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,000
The original ancestor was severely beaten

23
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:17,890
Thrown into the woodshed

24
00:01:17,890 --> 00:01:20,130
The original ancestor's body is too weak now

25
00:01:20,130 --> 00:01:21,730
I can't move at all now

26
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:24,500
Lingtian space

27
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,420
water give me water

28
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:44,200
Looks like a woodshed

29
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,440
It's outrageous. That's it.

30
00:01:45,440 --> 00:02:00,980
You're dead. If you continue to make trouble, I'll starve you for three days.

31
00:02:00,980 --> 00:02:03,550
Qin Laosun Emperor Liu Zhao

32
00:02:03,550 --> 00:02:05,310
You put me in a woodshed

33
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:08,530
You want to starve me to death

34
00:02:08,570 --> 00:02:12,100
Who starves you to death? If you don’t obey me, shut up.

35
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:13,140
Call the captain

36
00:02:13,140 --> 00:02:14,780
Call some old men in the village to come over

37
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:16,620
now immediately

38
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:20,860
What do you want to do to break off the engagement?

39
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:24,140
Today I broke up with the old Qin family and turned against you.

40
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:25,300
You eat and drink from home

41
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:29,020
I eat the scraps and drink the shabu-shabu water

42
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:30,780
All the centimeters I earn are given to my family

43
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:31,700
I sleep in the woodshed

44
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:32,700
You live in a townhouse

45
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:34,580
Eat white noodles and wear new clothes

46
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:35,540
Don't call anyone

47
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:37,020
I'll stand at the door and shout

48
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,340
Let the whole village see the old Qin family

49
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:44,010
How can you force your twenty-year-old son to die?

50
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:45,050
Go ask the captain

51
00:02:45,050 --> 00:02:57,020
Invite Grandpa Three again. Grandpa Five, let’s make a fuss.

52
00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:58,060
Bigger is better

53
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,380
Today’s cover-up department

54
00:02:59,380 --> 00:03:02,190
Must be torn clean

55
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,470
Stupidity at night

56
00:03:03,470 --> 00:03:04,980
The captain has to make the decision

57
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:06,940
This weapon can damage the door and cause colds.

58
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:08,020
we discipline him

59
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:12,940
Is it ridiculous that he actually wants to break off the relationship? Qin Tian, what do you think?

60
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,900
I was locked in the woodshed by them all day

61
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:16,580
No water, no coolness

62
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:19,540
I just opened this door and won't open it again

63
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:21,060
I might die in there

64
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:26,150
Then you don’t eat

65
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:29,430
I don't eat it myself

66
00:03:29,510 --> 00:03:31,190
Qin Youfu’s new tricks

67
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:32,630
Qin Jinling’s liberation shoes

68
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:33,590
where did it come from

69
00:03:33,590 --> 00:03:35,550
I earned more than 200 centimeters last year

70
00:03:35,550 --> 00:03:37,110
Where did the money and food go?
